WEBVTT

00:07.560 --> 00:09.670
<i>What did I just hear?</i>

00:09.670 --> 00:11.700
<i>It sounded like a video game sound effect.</i>

00:12.000 --> 00:13.450
<i>So tired...</i>

00:14.370 --> 00:16.000
<i>I don't wanna get up...</i>

00:16.490 --> 00:19.340
Are you... a human?

00:19.340 --> 00:21.870
But you're a drop, so...

00:21.870 --> 00:23.100
I get it.

00:23.100 --> 00:25.350
It's a human-shaped piece of meat.

00:25.350 --> 00:26.860
I'll try cutting it up.

00:27.230 --> 00:30.620
<b>Telulu Level 1</b>

00:27.370 --> 00:28.880
Wait just a minute!

00:31.460 --> 00:33.550
Y-You scared me!

00:33.550 --> 00:36.140
So you really are a human?

00:36.500 --> 00:38.800
I feel like that should be obvious!

00:38.800 --> 00:42.470
But why did a slime drop a human on death?

00:42.470 --> 00:44.760
A slime? Drop?

00:44.760 --> 00:46.320
It doesn't make sense.

00:46.320 --> 00:49.570
They normally drop bean sprouts.

00:49.570 --> 00:52.060
What is all this about slimes and drops?

00:52.060 --> 00:54.170
Are you actually sane?

00:54.170 --> 00:55.990
You really don't know?

00:56.350 --> 00:58.280
For real, what are you talking about?

00:59.580 --> 01:01.630
Watch me for a minute.

01:02.330 --> 01:04.040
m 5 0 l 240 0 l 245 5 l 245 42 l 240 47 l 5 47 l 0 42 l 0 5 l 5 0

01:02.330 --> 01:04.040
A slime appeared.

01:02.510 --> 01:03.700
A slime?

01:05.810 --> 01:07.250
Whoa, careful!

01:09.650 --> 01:10.420
Hey!

01:10.660 --> 01:12.720
I'm just... fine!

01:17.490 --> 01:18.990
Why are there bean sprouts?!

01:19.650 --> 01:23.610
The slimes on level 1 of 
Telulu drop bean sprouts.

01:23.610 --> 01:25.390
That's common knowledge.

01:25.390 --> 01:27.470
Not any knowledge I've ever heard of.

01:29.440 --> 01:32.260
What is this?! What's going on?!

01:32.260 --> 01:34.990
What the hell is going on here?!

01:41.080 --> 01:50.210
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

03:04.970 --> 03:09.940
<b>He's a Human That Was Dropped by a Slime</b>

03:11.040 --> 03:15.080
So... is that how bean sprouts are made?

03:15.740 --> 03:17.000
Well, bean sprouts...

03:17.820 --> 03:20.420
and everything else, really.

03:20.420 --> 03:22.220
Everything?

03:22.220 --> 03:26.810
Everything in this world is 
dropped by monsters in dungeons.

03:26.810 --> 03:29.160
You really don't know anything, do you?

03:31.530 --> 03:32.570
Hey...

03:32.570 --> 03:33.400
Yes?

03:33.400 --> 03:35.350
So we're not in Japan?

03:35.350 --> 03:36.770
Japan?

03:36.770 --> 03:38.470
But we're on Earth, right?

03:38.890 --> 03:40.280
Earth?

03:40.280 --> 03:42.540
<i>What is going on here?</i>

03:49.330 --> 03:52.990
It seems like you've been 
killing nothing but slimes.

03:52.990 --> 03:55.130
Aren't you gonna kill anything else?

03:55.130 --> 03:58.660
Slimes are the only monsters 
on level 1 of Telulu.

03:58.660 --> 04:00.840
So you're not going to any other levels?

04:00.840 --> 04:02.550
I'm too weak.

04:02.550 --> 04:05.220
You don't look weak to me...

04:05.530 --> 04:09.660
If I level up some, 
I might be able to go to level 2.

04:09.660 --> 04:12.350
Level? You can level up?

04:12.350 --> 04:13.690
Sure.

04:13.690 --> 04:15.980
Oh! Want to see?

04:16.460 --> 04:17.580
Here it is.

04:17.580 --> 04:18.770
Here what is?

04:18.770 --> 04:20.560
This is a status board.

04:22.880 --> 04:26.770
<b>"Emily"</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:26.770
<b>Level</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:26.770
<b>Status</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:26.770
<b>Strength</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:26.770
<b>Vitality</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:26.770
<b>Intelligence</b>

04:23.590 --> 04:25.890
This is my current status.

04:26.780 --> 04:29.080
<i>It really is just like a video game.</i>

04:29.080 --> 04:32.010
<i>Her HP is rated B, and her strength is C...</i>

04:32.010 --> 04:34.040
<i>And the rest... hmm...</i>

04:34.040 --> 04:36.860
<i>She looks like the typical 
power-based build.</i>

04:37.970 --> 04:39.560
Hey, there's a second page.

04:39.560 --> 04:40.800
Yes.

04:41.170 --> 04:44.390
This is my drop status.

04:42.010 --> 04:46.800
<b>Plants</b>

04:42.010 --> 04:46.800
<b>Animals</b>

04:42.010 --> 04:46.800
<b>Minerals</b>

04:42.010 --> 04:46.800
<b>Magic</b>

04:42.010 --> 04:46.800
<b>Specials</b>

04:42.010 --> 04:46.800
<b>"Emily"</b>

04:42.010 --> 04:46.800
<b>Level</b>

04:42.010 --> 04:46.800
<b>Drop Status</b>

04:44.390 --> 04:46.800
What does it mean when these stats are high?

04:46.800 --> 04:49.480
High levels make it easier to get drops,

04:49.480 --> 04:51.320
and increases the quantities you get.

04:51.690 --> 04:54.420
My highest level is in plants,

04:54.420 --> 04:56.810
so I'm getting bean sprouts here.

04:56.980 --> 04:59.020
I wouldn't call this "high."

04:59.020 --> 05:01.480
Just higher than the other ones.

05:02.050 --> 05:03.720
Want to try it?

05:03.720 --> 05:05.020
Sure.

05:05.020 --> 05:06.540
Do I just touch it?

05:06.920 --> 05:08.020
Yes.

05:12.950 --> 05:15.090
Your abilities are very low.

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>"Ryota"</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>Level</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>Status</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>Strength</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>Vitality</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>Intelligence</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>Will</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>Speed</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:23.630
<b>Dexterity</b>

05:12.970 --> 05:23.630
<b>Luck</b>

05:15.090 --> 05:16.750
Level 1...

05:16.750 --> 05:20.200
Does this mean the highest 
level I can ever reach is 1?

05:20.200 --> 05:22.060
That is what it means, yes.

05:22.060 --> 05:23.630
Yo, come on...

05:25.740 --> 05:28.130
Your drop status is quite sad, too.

05:29.430 --> 05:32.580
I don't have anything going for me at all.

05:32.580 --> 05:36.850
Let's see... A, B, C, D, E, F...

05:36.850 --> 05:38.840
Q, R, S...

05:38.840 --> 05:40.630
They're so low.

05:40.630 --> 05:41.360
Huh?

05:41.360 --> 05:50.990
<b>"Ryota"</b>

05:41.360 --> 05:50.990
<b>Level</b>

05:41.360 --> 05:50.990
<b>Status</b>

05:41.360 --> 05:50.990
<b>Plants</b>

05:41.360 --> 05:50.990
<b>Animals</b>

05:41.360 --> 05:50.990
<b>Minerals</b>

05:41.360 --> 05:50.990
<b>Magic</b>

05:41.380 --> 05:50.990
<b>Specials</b>

05:41.770 --> 05:46.130
With levels this low, you might 
not get any drops at all.

05:46.130 --> 05:49.000
Wait a minute! S is low?

05:49.000 --> 05:50.990
Huh? Well, it's...

05:50.990 --> 05:55.180
<i>Wait, my impression is 
that S is higher than A.</i>

05:50.990 --> 05:57.210
A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J, K...

05:55.180 --> 05:57.210
<i>Is it different here?</i>

05:57.540 --> 05:59.140
I'll try it out.

05:59.510 --> 06:01.600
What are you looking for?

06:01.600 --> 06:03.900
I'd like to find something 
that'll work as a weapon.

06:05.370 --> 06:07.220
Want to use mine?

06:07.220 --> 06:08.190
Thank—

06:09.850 --> 06:12.480
What does this weigh, a hundred kilos?

06:12.910 --> 06:14.720
I-I'm sorry!

06:15.740 --> 06:17.370
How about this one?

06:18.620 --> 06:21.070
<i>Ryota acquired a bamboo spear.</i>

06:18.890 --> 06:20.900
m 5 0 l 240 0 l 245 5 l 245 42 l 240 47 l 5 47 l 0 42 l 0 5 l 5 0

06:18.890 --> 06:20.900
m 5 0 l 240 0 l 245 5 l 245 42 l 240 47 l 5 47 l 0 42 l 0 5 l 5 0

06:18.890 --> 06:20.900
Ryota acquired a bamboo spear.

06:21.070 --> 06:22.690
This should work.

06:23.160 --> 06:24.820
Here comes a slime.

06:24.820 --> 06:26.400
m 5 0 l 240 0 l 245 5 l 245 42 l 240 47 l 5 47 l 0 42 l 0 5 l 5 0

06:24.820 --> 06:26.400
A slime appeared.

06:26.720 --> 06:28.030
All right!

06:36.660 --> 06:38.120
You did it!

06:41.290 --> 06:43.550
W-Wow!

06:44.120 --> 06:46.330
Have you ever gotten this many in a drop?

06:46.330 --> 06:47.420
No!

06:47.700 --> 06:52.260
I've been here about two years, 
and I've never seen a drop like this.

06:52.520 --> 06:57.000
Which must mean S really is above A.

06:57.540 --> 07:00.190
Have you seen the S rating anywhere else?

07:00.190 --> 07:01.640
No, I haven't.

07:01.640 --> 07:03.430
I've never even heard of it.

07:03.430 --> 07:04.680
I see...

07:07.770 --> 07:10.520
Let's eat together.

07:12.210 --> 07:13.840
Here you go.

07:15.370 --> 07:16.510
Thanks.

07:17.170 --> 07:18.290
Let's dig in.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.250
This is great!

07:23.620 --> 07:29.380
The subtle spice of the chili oil dressing 
is just right for the crispy bean sprouts!

07:30.330 --> 07:33.140
This would be a perfect beer snack!

07:33.140 --> 07:34.650
Really?

07:34.650 --> 07:36.430
You don't drink?

07:36.430 --> 07:40.850
No. Liquor is very expensive, 
so I can't even afford it.

07:41.390 --> 07:43.030
Try this, too.

07:43.030 --> 07:44.020
Thanks.

07:47.190 --> 07:48.300
It's warm...

07:54.820 --> 07:56.920
Wh-What's the matter?!

07:56.920 --> 07:58.700
Does it taste bad?!

07:58.700 --> 08:01.120
No, that's not it.

08:01.380 --> 08:06.040
It's just been so long since 
I sat down to eat a warm meal

08:06.990 --> 08:08.650
with someone else.

08:10.000 --> 08:11.770
<i>I left early every morning</i>

08:11.770 --> 08:14.580
<i>and got home late every night 
after doing unpaid overtime,</i>

08:14.580 --> 08:17.460
<i>so I'd just wolf down something 
cold from the convenience store.</i>

08:19.780 --> 08:22.270
<i>It ruined my health. 
I was even hospitalized.</i>

08:22.650 --> 08:24.990
<i>Then I thought I needed 
to make up for lost time.</i>

08:25.730 --> 08:29.980
<i>So I worked overtime again, 
and missed the last train, so I took a nap...</i>

08:30.690 --> 08:34.280
<i>And the next thing I knew, 
I was dropped by a slime.</i>

08:36.330 --> 08:39.940
<i>For real, nothing I did 
ever paid off in any way.</i>

08:39.940 --> 08:41.730
<i>Every day was hell.</i>

08:44.940 --> 08:47.680
This is something I once heard.

08:48.040 --> 08:50.780
One's efforts will always 
pay off in the end.

08:51.280 --> 08:54.170
How quickly or slowly it happens may vary,

08:54.170 --> 08:57.720
but those who work hard 
will always be rewarded.

08:57.720 --> 08:58.850
Even better,

08:59.330 --> 09:02.130
the longer you work hard 
without being rewarded,

09:02.130 --> 09:05.200
the greater your reward will be.

09:05.690 --> 09:10.770
It's like the tension in your thumb when 
you're about to flick someone's forehead.

09:10.770 --> 09:13.410
The greater the tension, 
the stronger the flick.

09:13.850 --> 09:16.080
So the most amazing way to do it

09:16.080 --> 09:20.340
is to be reborn and get your 
reward in your next life.

09:21.150 --> 09:23.830
I think you worked very hard,

09:24.410 --> 09:26.120
so all that's left for you now

09:26.760 --> 09:28.860
is to be rewarded.

09:36.040 --> 09:37.300
Thanks.

09:40.560 --> 09:43.310
I guess I should look for a place to stay.

09:43.310 --> 09:46.830
In that case, there's a town 
right outside the dungeon.

09:46.830 --> 09:49.190
You can find lodging there.

09:49.190 --> 09:51.480
I'm going to sleep soon myself.

09:51.480 --> 09:53.630
Huh? In here?

09:53.630 --> 09:56.910
Yes. My drops are all low,

09:56.910 --> 09:58.840
so I don't earn a lot.

09:59.210 --> 10:01.490
It's my dream to rent an apartment someday.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.500
I see...

10:07.300 --> 10:09.350
Oh! Take this with you!

10:09.710 --> 10:11.420
Huh? Are you sure?

10:12.360 --> 10:14.420
You'll have a hard time without a weapon.

10:14.420 --> 10:18.130
Okay. I'll borrow this 
and return it someday.

10:18.130 --> 10:18.970
Sure!

10:19.240 --> 10:22.890
I'm always here in level 1 of Telulu.

10:23.860 --> 10:25.060
What's your name?

10:25.310 --> 10:27.850
Emily Brown.

10:28.100 --> 10:29.230
Emily...

10:29.780 --> 10:31.770
I'm Sato Ryota.

10:31.770 --> 10:34.190
Hello... Yoda?

10:34.190 --> 10:36.190
Sato Ryota!

10:36.590 --> 10:39.440
I've never heard a name like that before.

10:41.810 --> 10:43.550
I'm getting the idea now.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.880
<i>The currency here is "pilos."</i>

10:46.550 --> 10:48.540
<i>Those bean sprouts are worth 200 pilos.</i>

10:48.540 --> 10:52.330
<i>A room just to sleep in 
is 2,000 pilos a night.</i>

10:52.330 --> 10:55.250
<i>A bowl of the closest thing they 
have to ramen is 500 pilos.</i>

10:55.510 --> 10:58.080
<i>I've verified the prices 
of the things I want.</i>

10:58.920 --> 11:00.570
<i>All that's left is...</i>

11:02.370 --> 11:03.670
<b>Telulu Level 1</b>

11:05.410 --> 11:07.800
<i>When I learned that I'm stuck at level 1,</i>

11:07.800 --> 11:12.480
<i>I thought that I was in for hell again, 
where nothing I did would ever pay off.</i>

11:12.900 --> 11:17.040
<i>But with this overpowered skill that 
puts all my drop rates at S...</i>

11:17.040 --> 11:18.820
<i>I can make it work this time!</i>

11:21.070 --> 11:22.000
Huh?

11:22.530 --> 11:23.820
What's this place?

11:23.820 --> 11:26.430
I rented it with what 
I earned in three days.

11:26.430 --> 11:27.740
Three days?!

11:27.740 --> 11:29.500
That's amazing, Yoda!

11:29.500 --> 11:34.130
Yeah, but it's just a run-down 
87-year-old apartment,

11:34.130 --> 11:36.420
so there's no deposit or key money.

11:36.730 --> 11:38.890
It was the best I could do in three days.

11:38.890 --> 11:40.990
That's still amazing!

11:40.990 --> 11:42.350
How much does it cost?

11:42.350 --> 11:44.080
Twenty thousand pilos a month.

11:44.080 --> 11:46.430
Twenty thousand... That's amazing.

11:48.240 --> 11:49.520
So amazing!

11:49.520 --> 11:51.660
And... here's this.

11:54.190 --> 11:55.540
What is it?

11:58.110 --> 11:59.070
The key.

11:59.070 --> 12:01.780
Huh? Why are you giving it to me?

12:01.780 --> 12:04.170
Can't live here from now on without it.

12:04.170 --> 12:05.450
Who's living here?

12:06.160 --> 12:07.260
You are.

12:07.850 --> 12:09.860
What?!

12:09.860 --> 12:12.650
I'll cover all the rent, 
so don't worry about that.

12:12.650 --> 12:14.950
B-But I can't accept this!

12:14.950 --> 12:16.590
It's to thank you for the soup.

12:18.000 --> 12:20.050
That soup was delicious...

12:20.500 --> 12:22.010
and warm.

12:23.760 --> 12:27.260
So I'm showing my gratitude. 
I wish it was a nicer place,

12:27.260 --> 12:28.780
but I want you to live here.

12:30.390 --> 12:31.870
All right.

12:31.870 --> 12:34.090
Okay, I'll get going, then.

12:35.400 --> 12:37.720
Your hands are covered in blisters.

12:37.720 --> 12:40.010
Huh? Oh, sorry.

12:40.760 --> 12:44.350
I might have gotten some blood 
on the spear you lent me,

12:44.350 --> 12:46.140
but I'll wash it before I return it.

12:46.140 --> 12:48.030
And you have bags under your eyes.

12:48.760 --> 12:51.040
Once they clear up, 
that's when I'll really get started.

12:51.590 --> 12:52.670
I'll...

12:53.290 --> 12:54.460
make more soup.

12:54.460 --> 12:57.630
Okay, then, I'll just take a bowl—

12:58.220 --> 12:59.550
I'll make it for the rest of my life!

12:59.950 --> 13:01.550
So please enjoy it with me!

13:02.060 --> 13:04.800
Huh? D-Does that mean...

13:07.140 --> 13:09.340
<i>Is she asking me to live with her?</i>

13:09.830 --> 13:11.060
<i>Can I do that?</i>

13:13.100 --> 13:14.120
Okay?

13:14.940 --> 13:24.950
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:14.940 --> 13:24.950
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:15.520 --> 13:17.350
Uh... Upsy-daisy.

13:22.160 --> 13:23.090
Here!

13:23.090 --> 13:24.240
Seriously, how?!

13:33.930 --> 13:35.460
Got more for you, Erza.

13:35.460 --> 13:38.310
Sure. One moment, please.

13:39.540 --> 13:42.240
You're, um... Drunken Sato?

13:42.240 --> 13:43.650
It's Ryota!

13:43.650 --> 13:45.660
Oh, I'm sorry.

13:45.660 --> 13:48.470
You just have such a difficult name.

13:50.010 --> 13:53.190
That's a total of 1,967 pilos.

13:53.710 --> 13:57.500
Since you always bring in such large amounts,

13:57.500 --> 14:00.090
I'll round it up to 2,000 this time.

14:00.090 --> 14:00.940
Thanks.

14:01.280 --> 14:05.330
But they're still just bean sprouts, 
so they don't fetch a lot, huh?

14:05.330 --> 14:07.820
Maybe I'll try the second level of Telulu.

14:07.820 --> 14:10.740
The monsters on the 
second level drop carrots.

14:11.850 --> 14:14.220
<i>That's surreal! Too surreal!</i>

14:15.080 --> 14:19.120
<i>But that's just how things are 
in this world, I guess...</i>

14:19.550 --> 14:24.210
Oh, did you know about the new 
dungeon that came about recently?

14:24.210 --> 14:26.760
What? Dungeons just... show up?

14:27.160 --> 14:30.140
Yes, every now and then.

14:30.140 --> 14:33.450
But the name is kind of difficult to say.

14:33.450 --> 14:35.430
Nibo... No, that's not it...

14:35.430 --> 14:38.190
Nihonium. That's the name, I think.

14:38.190 --> 14:39.550
Nihonium?

14:39.960 --> 14:41.110
That's easy to say.

14:41.110 --> 14:42.880
Is it?

14:42.880 --> 14:46.690
The Neptune Group is investigating 
what's dropped there,

14:46.690 --> 14:48.530
so we'll know soon.

14:48.530 --> 14:50.420
Neptune Group?

14:50.420 --> 14:52.050
You don't know them?

14:52.050 --> 14:54.860
They're the most powerful 
organization in Secro.

14:54.860 --> 14:55.690
Huh...

14:58.070 --> 15:00.240
Sorry for holding you up.

15:00.240 --> 15:01.350
I'll be on my way.

15:01.350 --> 15:02.580
Wait!

15:03.180 --> 15:06.110
There's a new shop just out on the corner,

15:06.110 --> 15:08.460
and they have delicious beer!

15:08.460 --> 15:12.010
W-Would you like to go there with me today?

15:12.010 --> 15:13.360
Beer, huh?

15:14.440 --> 15:16.900
Sorry, I'll have to pass today.

15:16.900 --> 15:17.860
See ya next time.

15:18.250 --> 15:20.390
Y-Yes, next time...

15:21.000 --> 15:23.410
Aw, shot down, huh? What a shame.

15:23.960 --> 15:26.190
I-It wasn't anything like that!

15:27.410 --> 15:31.090
<i>It's been decades since I came home 
to a place where someone was waiting.</i>

15:31.090 --> 15:32.570
<i>What do I say?</i>

15:33.570 --> 15:34.990
<i>It's gotta be...</i>

15:35.370 --> 15:37.080
I-I'm how—

15:37.080 --> 15:37.910
home.

15:38.190 --> 15:39.790
Welcome home!

15:40.200 --> 15:41.910
I-I'm home.

15:41.910 --> 15:44.130
Yes, welcome home!

15:45.250 --> 15:46.800
Is it me...

15:46.800 --> 15:49.130
or is it a whole lot cleaner now?

15:49.350 --> 15:51.590
Yes, I cleaned it up.

15:51.590 --> 15:55.390
This goes way beyond just "cleaning up."

15:55.390 --> 15:57.060
I shouldn't have?

15:57.310 --> 16:00.380
It was my first time cleaning a place,

16:00.380 --> 16:02.390
so I went all-out.

16:02.810 --> 16:05.340
Here you go, Yoda. A hot towel.

16:05.860 --> 16:08.710
Man, this feels great!

16:08.710 --> 16:10.440
Thank you, Emily!

16:10.800 --> 16:12.230
I also made tea.

16:12.230 --> 16:14.160
You made tea, too?!

16:14.390 --> 16:16.930
Yes. Have a seat and wait a moment.

16:17.830 --> 16:19.960
You don't have to do all this.

16:19.960 --> 16:21.480
Why don't you take a break?

16:21.480 --> 16:22.580
You must be tired.

16:24.140 --> 16:28.030
Being able to do things around my home 
is such a new feeling! I love it!

16:28.030 --> 16:29.880
I'm not tired at all!

16:29.880 --> 16:31.820
Okay, I guess...

16:34.640 --> 16:38.320
By the way, I heard a new dungeon showed up.

16:38.320 --> 16:40.060
It's called Nihonium.

16:41.000 --> 16:42.270
I heard.

16:42.270 --> 16:46.240
It's apparently a useless dungeon 
where nothing drops at all.

16:46.240 --> 16:48.510
Nothing drops at all?

16:49.690 --> 16:53.280
<i>In a world where everything 
drops in dungeons,</i>

16:53.280 --> 16:56.950
<i>the idea of one with no drops 
is even more intriguing.</i>

16:53.300 --> 16:56.940
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

16:57.830 --> 16:59.290
<i>No one's around.</i>

16:59.290 --> 17:01.170
<i>It feels abandoned.</i>

17:01.170 --> 17:02.840
<i>Maybe there really is nothing...</i>

17:07.630 --> 17:08.630
Huh?

17:17.220 --> 17:18.310
<i>I'm dead!</i>

17:35.120 --> 17:37.740
<i>That's all I can do at level 1...</i>

17:38.100 --> 17:40.120
<i>Am I really that weak?</i>

17:42.010 --> 17:43.390
What's that?

17:44.460 --> 17:45.460
A seed?

17:47.710 --> 17:50.760
<i>Ryota's max HP increased by 1.</i>

17:47.710 --> 17:51.920
m 3 0 l 310 0 l 313 3 l 313 22 l 310 25 l 3 25 l 0 22 l 0 3

17:47.710 --> 17:51.920
Ryota's max HP increased by 1.

17:51.220 --> 17:51.920
Huh?

17:52.290 --> 17:53.240
Huh?!

17:53.630 --> 17:55.630
What?!

17:55.240 --> 17:59.380
<b>"Ryota" 
Level 1/1 
Status 
HP C
MP F
Strength F 
Vitality F 
Intelligence F 
Will F 
Speed F 
Dexterity F 
Luck F</b>

17:55.630 --> 18:00.320
Your level is still 1, 
but your HP increased!

18:00.320 --> 18:02.010
You're amazing, Ryota!

18:00.320 --> 18:02.010
<i>It really did.</i>

18:02.330 --> 18:04.930
So that seed's effect was real.

18:05.300 --> 18:09.270
<i>I thought this just might work, 
so I killed a ton of skeletons.</i>

18:09.270 --> 18:13.030
<i>Then Emily joined me, so we did some 
research and learned a few things.</i>

18:13.580 --> 18:17.950
<i>When Emily killed a skeleton, 
the seed didn't drop.</i>

18:18.460 --> 18:21.820
<i>When she tries to pick up a 
seed from one of my kills,</i>

18:21.820 --> 18:23.370
<i>her hand passes right through it.</i>

18:23.660 --> 18:26.630
<i>And I'm the only one who 
can hear that voice.</i>

18:26.250 --> 18:29.790
m 3 0 l 310 0 l 313 3 l 313 22 l 310 25 l 3 25 l 0 22 l 0 3

18:26.250 --> 18:29.790
Ryota's max HP increased by 1.

18:26.630 --> 18:29.790
<i>Ryota's max HP increased by 1.</i>

18:29.790 --> 18:31.960
This can't be possible.

18:32.410 --> 18:33.500
<i>She's right.</i>

18:33.500 --> 18:37.350
<i>In this world, drops that only 
certain people can touch</i>

18:37.350 --> 18:39.410
<i>will throw off the balance of things.</i>

18:39.970 --> 18:42.970
<i>So they shouldn't even exist at all.</i>

18:43.980 --> 18:46.270
<i>And yet... there it was.</i>

18:46.700 --> 18:48.130
Amazing!

18:48.130 --> 18:51.690
I've never heard of anyone getting 
stronger without leveling up!

18:51.950 --> 18:54.440
<i>In other words, Nihonium here...</i>

18:54.810 --> 18:58.580
<i>is a stat-increasing 
dungeon for S-ranks only!</i>

19:01.590 --> 19:05.290
Yum! Emily's house is the best!

19:05.750 --> 19:08.370
Ryota, will you be out late again tonight?

19:08.570 --> 19:12.500
Yeah. After busting my butt 
in Nihonium so much lately,

19:12.500 --> 19:16.300
my max HP finally made it up to rank S.

19:16.600 --> 19:18.960
So today I'm gonna go to level 2 of Telulu

19:18.960 --> 19:22.050
and see how much stronger I am.

19:22.320 --> 19:24.730
What? Why are you making that face?

19:25.440 --> 19:27.820
Please don't be too reckless.

19:27.820 --> 19:28.640
Huh?

19:28.890 --> 19:31.180
You do tend to be reckless.

19:31.550 --> 19:35.400
When you first rented this apartment, 
you looked exhausted.

19:35.400 --> 19:38.040
And you've been out late 
every night recently.

19:38.040 --> 19:40.800
I'd like you to come home 
at night, if you can.

19:42.250 --> 19:46.510
<i>Back then, no one worried about me at all.</i>

19:47.200 --> 19:48.580
<i>But now...</i>

19:49.680 --> 19:52.580
All right. I'll be back before nightfall.

19:52.810 --> 19:53.800
Okay!

19:56.920 --> 19:58.380
m 5 0 l 305 0 l 310 5 l 310 42 l 305 47 l 5 47 l 0 42 l 0 5 l 5 0

19:56.920 --> 19:58.380
A Sleepy Slime appeared.

19:59.550 --> 20:02.220
Wait, that didn't hurt at all.

20:02.220 --> 20:03.720
I get it!

20:03.720 --> 20:06.060
So this is what it means to have S-rank HP!

20:16.600 --> 20:18.900
It really did drop a carrot!

20:18.900 --> 20:20.290
And it's huge.

20:30.000 --> 20:31.770
<i>It's smaller than mine...</i>

20:31.770 --> 20:34.050
What're you doing just standing there?

20:34.950 --> 20:38.150
Is a newbie like you really 
ready for level 2?

20:38.150 --> 20:39.840
I'll check his status.

20:40.220 --> 20:41.340
<i>Easy Scan.</i>

20:42.150 --> 20:43.680
Level 1...

20:46.410 --> 20:50.270
Better get back to the first 
level if you don't wanna die.

20:50.790 --> 20:53.640
What's with those guys?

21:02.540 --> 21:04.180
Are those ears...

21:04.180 --> 21:05.230
natural?

21:05.530 --> 21:06.810
Level 1?

21:07.600 --> 21:08.780
Who, me?

21:09.170 --> 21:11.510
Yeah, I am level 1.

21:11.510 --> 21:13.050
I hate low levels.

21:15.010 --> 21:16.590
Wh-What was that?

21:20.470 --> 21:22.800
What the heck was that?!

21:24.720 --> 21:26.680
What big carrots!

21:26.950 --> 21:29.820
They really liked them at 
The Swallow's Gratitude,

21:29.820 --> 21:32.100
so they bought them for 8,000 pilos!

21:32.100 --> 21:34.490
You made 8,000 pilos in one day?

21:34.490 --> 21:35.770
Wow...

21:35.770 --> 21:38.260
<i>A month of that would give me 240,000 pilos.</i>

21:38.260 --> 21:40.680
<i>That's more than I was making in my old job!</i>

21:41.320 --> 21:43.740
I kept enough for us to eat.

21:44.000 --> 21:46.130
I'll make something tasty with them!

21:48.730 --> 21:49.780
Yes?

21:50.840 --> 21:52.580
The girl from before...

21:54.630 --> 21:56.540
I hate low levels.

21:56.540 --> 21:59.710
Uh, was it really necessary 
to come to my house for that?

22:00.380 --> 22:02.380
What? You need something?

22:03.650 --> 22:04.940
I wuv you.

22:05.430 --> 22:06.130
Wha...

22:06.370 --> 22:09.070
What?!

22:09.070 --> 22:11.070
Huh?
